    {
      "example": "demoinstance1",
      "help_en": "The name of the Image Search instance. The name can be up to 20 characters in length.\nIf you have purchased an Image Search instance, log on to the Image Search console (https://imagesearch.console.aliyun.com/) to view the instance name.\nIf you have not purchased an Image Search instance, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/179178.html and https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/66569.html.\nThe instance name is not the instance ID. Make sure you distinguish between them",
      "help_zh": "图搜实例名称。最多支持20个字符。\n如果已经购买图搜实例可登录图像搜索管控台 (https://imagesearch.console.aliyun.com/)查看。\n如果没有购买图搜实例可参考https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/179178.html和https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/66569.html。\n这里的实例名称并非实例ID，使用时请区分",
