    {
      "example": "int_attr=1000 AND str_attr=\"value1\"",
      "help_en": "The filter condition. The int_attr field supports the following operators: in, not in, greater than (>), greater than or equal to (>=), less than (<), less than or equal to (<=), and equal to (=). The str_attr field supports the following operators: in, not in, equal to (=), and not equal to (!=). You can use AND and OR to connect multiple conditions.\nExamples:\nint_attr >= 100.\nstr_attr != \"value1\".\nint_attr = 1000 AND str_attr = \"value1\".\n\nThe filter condition can be up to 4,096 characters in length",
      "help_zh": "过滤条件。int_attr支持的操作符有in、not in、大于号(>)、大于等于号(>=)、小于号(<)、小于等于号(<=)、等于号(=)。str_attr支持的操作符有in、not in、等于号(=)和不等号(!=)，多个条件之间支持AND和OR进行连接。\n例如：\nint_attr >= 100。\nstr_attr != \"value1\"。\nint_attr = 1000 AND str_attr = \"value1\"。\n\n最多支持4096个字符",
      "location": "formData",
      "name": "filter",
      "options": [
        "--filter"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Filter",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "false",
      "help_en": "If this parameter is set to true, duplicate data is removed based on the ProductId field during the search",
      "help_zh": "如果为true则检索时根据ProductId字段进行去重复数据",
